# Production Deployment Checklist

See `DEPLOYMENT.md` for full, platform-specific steps.

## Configuration (config.py)

- All settings come from `config.py` (env-driven, loads `.env` via
  python-dotenv). Do not scatter `os.environ.get` across the codebase.
- `config.validate()` / `config.log_warnings()` run at startup and warn about
  insecure production settings.

## Pre-deployment

- [ ] `FLASK_ENV=production`
- [ ] Strong `SECRET_KEY` set (not the `dev` default)
- [ ] `QOIN_WALLET_ENCRYPTION_KEY` set
- [ ] `DATABASE_URL` configured (PostgreSQL recommended over SQLite)
- [ ] Email service configured (`MAIL_*`) if recovery/notifications are used
- [ ] `SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=true` when served over HTTPS
- [ ] No secrets committed (`.env` is git-ignored; `.env.example` is the template)

## Deployment

- [ ] Push to GitHub
- [ ] Deploy to Render / Railway / Fly.io
- [ ] Set environment variables in the cloud dashboard
- [ ] Mount a persistent volume at `/data` if using SQLite
- [ ] Run database migrations (`python init_db.py`, seed scripts)
- [ ] Docker `HEALTHCHECK` on `/` reports healthy

## Post-deployment smoke test

- [ ] `/` returns 200
- [ ] Registration → auto-login → dashboard
- [ ] Login / logout
- [ ] Wallet balance renders; test transaction settles (weekly settlement logic)
- [ ] Post escalation timer behaves
- [ ] Language switching localizes UI strings and location names
- [ ] Logs show no `SECRET_KEY=dev` (or other) config warnings
